  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP-ELECT Fas ll, 2014-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP-ELECT Phase ll, 2014-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">De avsedda resultaten av interventionen &#xe4;r att den institutionella kapaciteten hos
Afghanistans oberoende valkommission (IEC) f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttras, att Afghanistan har en
h&#xe5;llbar l&#xe5;ngsiktig strategi f&#xf6;r v&#xe4;ljarregistrering och den informativa upps&#xf6;kande verksamheten med nyckel
intressenter och v&#xe4;ljark&#xe5;ren f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttras. Inom ramen f&#xf6;r detta bidrag st&#xf6;dde Sverige
Afghanistans presidentval 2014.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intended outcomes of the intervention are that the institutional capacity of the
Independent Election Commission (IEC) of Afghanistan is improved, that Afghanistan has a
sustainable longterm approach to voter registration, and that informational outreach with key
stakeholders an the electorate is enhanced. Within this contribution, Sweden supported the
Afghanistan Presidential elections in 2014.</narrative>
  </description>
